---
import BaseLayout from '@layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ScrollTimelineScript from '@/components/ui/ScrollTimelineScript.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Case studies — Blue Unicorn"
  description="Real case studies: from patent to Amazon, e-bikes with SORIE™, and industrialized products. Results on the ground, not promises."
  image="/images/og-casos.jpg"
  showHeader={true}
>

<section class="relative overflow-hidden flex items-end" style="background:#0F2548;">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute right-0 top-0 bottom-0 w-1/2 md:w-2/5 opacity-[0.07]" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg, transparent 40%, #0088B3 100%);"></div>
    <span class="absolute select-none pointer-events-none" style="right:-0.05em;bottom:-0.22em;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(8rem,28vw,22rem);line-height:0.8;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.03);letter-spacing:-0.06em;">CASES</span>
  </div>
  <div class="relative z-10 w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 pt-16 pb-5 md:pt-20 md:pb-6" data-reveal>
    <p class="reveal-item text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-3" style="--i:0;color:#0088B3;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Blue Unicorn</p>
    <h1 class="reveal-item leading-[0.92] tracking-tight mb-3" style="--i:1;color:#ffffff;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(3rem,8vw,5.5rem);text-wrap:balance;">
      Case studies
    </h1>
    <p class="reveal-item text-lg md:text-xl max-w-[42ch] leading-relaxed mb-4" style="--i:2;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
      Real projects in business development, product and import. Ideas that reached the factory, Amazon and the market.
    </p>
    <nav class="reveal-item flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap gap-4 sm:gap-x-10 sm:gap-y-3" style="--i:3" aria-label="Jump to a case">
      <a href="/en/case-studies/roll-order/" class="caso-link inline-flex items-baseline gap-3 no-underline" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em]" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">01</span>
        <span class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold" style="color:#A8D8EA;">Roll Order</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/case-studies/electric-bike/" class="caso-link inline-flex items-baseline gap-3 no-underline" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em]" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">02</span>
        <span class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold" style="color:#A8D8EA;">Electric bike</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/case-studies/utrilla/" class="caso-link inline-flex items-baseline gap-3 no-underline" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em]" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">03</span>
        <span class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold" style="color:#A8D8EA;">Utrilla</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/en/case-studies/other-stories/" class="caso-link inline-flex items-baseline gap-3 no-underline" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em]" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);">+</span>
        <span class="text-base md:text-lg font-semibold" style="color:#A8D8EA;">Other stories</span>
      </a>
    </nav>
  </div>
</section>

<article id="roll-order" class="caso-block relative overflow-hidden" style="background:#FFFFFF;">
  <span class="caso-bg-num caso-bg-num--left select-none pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true" style="color:rgba(22,54,103,0.03);">01</span>
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-8 md:py-12">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="reveal-item text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-5" style="--i:0;color:#0F2548;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Business · Product · Amazon</p>
        <h2 class="reveal-item text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-3" style="--i:1;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;text-wrap:balance;">Roll Order</h2>
        <p class="reveal-item text-lg font-medium mb-8 max-w-[36ch] leading-snug" style="--i:2;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#163667;">
          From a patent document to a product selling on Amazon.
        </p>
        <div class="reveal-item space-y-6 max-w-[48ch]" style="--i:3">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:#6B7280;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Challenge</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:#374151;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              The client arrived with patent documentation. They had a protected idea — but not the product, the factory, or the sales channel.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:#6B7280;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">What we did</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:#374151;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              We developed the product end to end: industrialization, manufacturing, packaging, logistics and import. Then the Amazon launch and promotion.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:#6B7280;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Result</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:#374151;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              Product industrialized, imported and launched on Amazon. The patent stopped being a document and became a business in the market.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="https://roll-order.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="reveal-item caso-link mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold no-underline" style="--i:4;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#0F2548;">
          roll-order.com
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 17L17 7M7 7h10v10"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="caso-visual relative flex justify-center lg:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="pipeline relative w-full max-w-[420px]" data-scroll-timeline>
          <div class="pipeline-track">
            <div class="pipeline-fill" data-timeline-fill></div>
          </div>
          <ol class="flex flex-col gap-0 m-0 p-0">
            <li class="pipeline-step" data-timeline-item data-paso="1" style="--c:#0F2548;">
              <span class="pipeline-dot" data-timeline-node data-paso="1" data-color="#0F2548" style="background:#0F2548;border-color:#0F2548;"></span>
              <span class="pipeline-label">Patent</span>
            </li>
            <li class="pipeline-step" data-timeline-item data-paso="2" style="--c:#163667;">
              <span class="pipeline-dot" data-timeline-node data-paso="2" data-color="#163667" style="background:#FFFFFF;border-color:#163667;"></span>
              <span class="pipeline-label">Product</span>
            </li>
            <li class="pipeline-step" data-timeline-item data-paso="3" style="--c:#0B4F7A;">
              <span class="pipeline-dot" data-timeline-node data-paso="3" data-color="#0B4F7A" style="background:#FFFFFF;border-color:#0B4F7A;"></span>
              <span class="pipeline-label">Factory</span>
            </li>
            <li class="pipeline-step" data-timeline-item data-paso="4" style="--c:#00698D;">
              <span class="pipeline-dot" data-timeline-node data-paso="4" data-color="#00698D" style="background:#FFFFFF;border-color:#00698D;"></span>
              <span class="pipeline-label">Import</span>
            </li>
            <li class="pipeline-step pipeline-step--last" data-timeline-item data-paso="5" style="--c:#0088B3;">
              <span class="pipeline-dot" data-timeline-node data-paso="5" data-color="#0088B3" style="background:#FFFFFF;border-color:#0088B3;"></span>
              <span class="pipeline-label">Amazon</span>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<article id="e-bike" class="caso-block relative overflow-hidden" style="background:#0A1628;">
  <span class="caso-bg-num caso-bg-num--right select-none pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);">02</span>
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-8 md:py-12">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="reveal-item text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-5" style="--i:0;color:#A8D8EA;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Product · SORIE™ · Import</p>
        <h2 class="reveal-item text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-3" style="--i:1;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#ffffff;text-wrap:balance;">Shared-use electric bike</h2>
        <p class="reveal-item text-lg font-medium mb-8 max-w-[40ch] leading-snug" style="--i:2;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);">
          The perfect bike checklist — and tariffs that jumped from 10% to 70%.
        </p>
        <div class="reveal-item space-y-6 max-w-[48ch]" style="--i:3">
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Challenge</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              A Spanish client building charging stations and e-bike rental for municipalities. Bikes bought in Spain were failing: stolen seats and baskets, snap-off kickstands, and other design issues for heavy shared use.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">What we did</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              We defined the perfect bike and applied SORIE™: competition analysis, manufacturers, trade fairs, and a factory trip with the CEO. We developed the full product — including how to navigate the tariff hike from 10% to 70%.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.14em] uppercase mb-1.5" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.35);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Result</p>
            <p class="text-base leading-relaxed" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
              A product built for urban rental, suppliers validated at origin, and a cost structure adapted to the new tariff scenario.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <a href="/en/sorie-methodology" class="reveal-item caso-link mt-10 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold no-underline" style="--i:4;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#A8D8EA;">
          See SORIE™ methodology
          <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>
      <div class="caso-visual relative flex justify-center lg:justify-end" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="arancel-sorie w-full max-w-[420px] flex flex-col gap-10" data-arancel-sorie>
          <div class="flex items-end justify-between gap-4 px-2">
            <div class="arancel-stat flex flex-col items-center gap-2.5 flex-1" style="--i:0;">
              <span class="arancel-num font-bold leading-none tracking-tighter" data-count-to="10" data-count-suffix="%" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,5rem);color:#A8D8EA;">0%</span>
              <span class="arancel-label text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">Before</span>
            </div>
            <div class="arancel-arrow pb-10" style="color:#0088B3;">
              <svg width="52" height="30" viewBox="0 0 40 24" fill="none"><path d="M2 12h30M24 4l12 8-12 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div class="arancel-stat flex flex-col items-center gap-2.5 flex-1" style="--i:1;">
              <span class="arancel-num font-bold leading-none tracking-tighter" data-count-to="70" data-count-suffix="%" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(3.5rem,8vw,5rem);color:#ffffff;">0%</span>
              <span class="arancel-label text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">Tariff</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="arancel-sorie-letters flex justify-between items-end px-1 pt-3 border-t" style="border-color:rgba(255,255,255,0.12);">
            <span class="sorie-letter font-bold tracking-tighter leading-none" style="--i:0;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.75rem,6vw,3.75rem);color:#A8D8EA;">S</span>
            <span class="sorie-letter font-bold tracking-tighter leading-none" style="--i:1;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.75rem,6vw,3.75rem);color:#7EC8E3;">O</span>
            <span class="sorie-letter font-bold tracking-tighter leading-none" style="--i:2;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.75rem,6vw,3.75rem);color:#0088B3;">R</span>
            <span class="sorie-letter font-bold tracking-tighter leading-none" style="--i:3;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.75rem,6vw,3.75rem);color:#40B0D0;">I</span>
            <span class="sorie-letter font-bold tracking-tighter leading-none" style="--i:4;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2.75rem,6vw,3.75rem);color:#ffffff;">E</span>
          </div>
          <p class="arancel-caption text-center text-sm font-semibold tracking-[0.16em] uppercase" style="font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.4);">Methodology applied</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<section id="other-stories" class="relative overflow-hidden" style="background:#0A1628;" data-reveal>
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute left-0 bottom-0 w-2/3 h-2/3 opacity-[0.06]" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 80%, #0088B3 0%, transparent 60%);"></div>
  </div>
  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="reveal-item text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-4" style="--i:0;color:#0088B3;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">And also</p>
    <h2 class="reveal-item font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.08] mb-4 max-w-[28ch]" style="--i:1;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#ffffff;font-size:clamp(1.85rem,4.5vw,3rem);text-wrap:balance;">
      Other stories
    </h2>
    <p class="reveal-item text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-[46ch] mb-12" style="--i:2;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.5);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
      Projects beyond the main cases — padel smartwatch and vehicle import.
    </p>

    <a href="/en/case-studies/other-stories/#padel-smartwatch" class="reveal-item group flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 sm:gap-8 p-5 md:p-6 rounded-xl no-underline mb-10" style="--i:3;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
      <div class="w-full sm:w-40 h-28 sm:h-auto sm:min-h-[7rem] rounded-lg overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0" style="background:#F3F4F6;">
        <img src="/images/smartwatch-padelnof-menu.png" alt="" class="max-w-full max-h-full object-contain p-2" />
      </div>
      <div class="min-w-0 flex flex-col justify-center">
        <p class="text-[11px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-semibold mb-2" style="color:#00C8C4;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Industrialization · Import</p>
        <h3 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-2" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#ffffff;">Padel smartwatch</h3>
        <p class="text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed max-w-[42ch]" style="color:rgba(255,255,255,0.55);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
          From prototype to the Barcelona fair. Industrialization, logistics, and import.
        </p>
        <span class="mt-3 text-sm font-semibold" style="color:#00C8C4;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Read the story →</span>
      </div>
    </a>

    <p class="reveal-item text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-[46ch]" style="--i:4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.45);font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
      Also vehicle import and music / digital marketing — <a href="/en/case-studies/other-stories/" class="font-semibold no-underline" style="color:#00C8C4;">see other stories →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background:#FFFFFF;" data-reveal>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-16 md:py-24 flex flex-col items-center" style="text-align:center;">
    <p class="reveal-item font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.2]" style="--i:0;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:clamp(1.35rem,3vw,2rem);text-wrap:balance;">
      Behind these projects is a team that works from the ground — product, manufacturing and digital channels.
      <a href="/en/about-us" class="caso-link whitespace-nowrap" style="color:#163667;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;">Learn more on About us</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background:#F2F5F8;" data-reveal>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-14 md:py-20 flex flex-col items-center" style="text-align:center;">
    <p class="reveal-item text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase mb-5" style="--i:0;color:#0088B3;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Press</p>
    <h2 class="reveal-item font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.1] mb-5" style="--i:1;font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;font-size:clamp(1.85rem,4.5vw,3rem);text-wrap:balance;">
      Featured in Cinco Días
    </h2>
    <p class="reveal-item text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-[48ch]" style="--i:2;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#374151;text-align:center;">
      The firm is led by Luis Chicharro, with a track record in business development, internationalization, proprietary brand creation, and scaling through digital channels. His approach was featured in <a href="https://cincodias.elpais.com/companias/2023-04-11/los-secretos-para-vender-en-plataformas-como-amazon.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="color:#163667;font-weight:700;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;">Cinco Días (Grupo El País)</a>, where he explained how to build real businesses on digital platforms — from product and manufacturing to sales.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="relative flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-12 md:gap-20 px-6 md:px-12 py-12 md:py-32" style="background:#FFFFFF;" data-final-cta>
  <div class="text-center md:text-left max-w-lg">
    <h2 class="final-title text-4xl md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-[1.05]" style="font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;color:#1A1A1A;">The next case<br>could be<br>yours</h2>
    <p class="final-body mt-6 text-base md:text-lg leading-relaxed" style="color:#6B7280;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">Results on the ground, not promises. Tell us your idea and we'll see if it fits.</p>
    <div class="final-cta mt-8">
      <a href="/en/get-started" class="animated-btn" style="position:relative;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:56px;padding:0 52px 0 36px;font-size:16px;background-color:#0F2548;border-radius:4px;font-weight:600;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;color:#ffffff;cursor:pointer;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 0.625em 1.2em 0 rgba(15,37,72,0.2);">
        <span class="text" style="position:relative;z-index:2;transition:transform 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1);">Start a conversation</span>
        <svg class="arr-1" style="position:absolute;top:50%;margin-top:-10px;width:20px;height:20px;z-index:2;right:22px;transition:all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1);" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        <svg class="arr-2" style="position:absolute;top:50%;margin-top:-10px;width:20px;height:20px;z-index:2;left:-25%;transition:all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1);" fill="none" stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        <span class="circle" style="position:absolute;top:50%;left:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:20px;height:20px;background-color:#00698D;border-radius:50%;opacity:0;transition:all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1);"></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-6 md:gap-8 shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="final-shape w-20 h-20 md:w-24 md:h-24" style="--i:0"><path d="M50 8 Q50 50 92 50 Q50 50 50 92 Q50 50 8 50 Q50 50 50 8Z" fill="#0F2548" opacity="0.8"/></svg>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="final-shape w-20 h-20 md:w-24 md:h-24" style="--i:1"><rect x="8" y="8" width="84" height="84" rx="3" fill="#163667" opacity="0.8"/></svg>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="final-shape w-20 h-20 md:w-24 md:h-24" style="--i:2"><circle cx="50" cy="50" r="42" fill="#0B4F7A" opacity="0.8"/></svg>
    <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" class="final-shape w-20 h-20 md:w-24 md:h-24" style="--i:3"><polygon points="50,4 96,96 4,96" fill="#00698D" opacity="0.8"/></svg>
  </div>
</section>

<footer style="background:#0F2548;font-family:'Satoshi',sans-serif;">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 py-8 md:py-20">
